## Claude — round 2 review

I have what I need — codex's Q2 point is confirmed to the line, my round-1 lens ambiguity is resolved, and the INV-1 precedent and the "first numeric invariant" claim both check out. Writing the round-2 review now (delivered as my reply, per the board protocol — no files, no plan-mode summary).

